{"id":"n60341-1-4","stage":1,"title":"그런 · 那种","scene":"工作与沟通","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60341-1-4-1","ko":"내 말은, 네가 맡은 일을 좀 똑바로 하라는 거야.","zh":"我的意思是，让你把分内的事好好做好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我的","explanation":"내 是 나의 的缩略形式，修饰后面的 말。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"말은,","meaning":"我的意思","explanation":"내 말은 在这里引出说话者真正想表达的内容。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말은","audio":"/audio/4353d67e9824943836b4.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"맡은","meaning":"负责","explanation":"맡다：负责；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"맡다","audio":"/audio/0ce6c4ebbc3bfd2367dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62827","senseId":"1","lemma":"맡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맡은","audio":"/audio/c802367daf9ca2013502.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"똑바로","meaning":"认真、好好地","explanation":"똑바로 하다 在这里是把负责的工作认真做好，不是身体方向“直着做”。","readings":[{"term":"똑바로","audio":"/audio/934c2296a0e275800788.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70810","senseId":"2","lemma":"똑바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"똑바로","audio":"/audio/934c2296a0e275800788.mp3"}},{"text":"하라는","meaning":"要你做好","explanation":"-라는 引述要求或命令；하라는 거야 在这里是“我是叫你认真做”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하라는","audio":"/audio/6d338a75722d336a7c12.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"我的意思是","explanation":"-라는 거야 将前面的要求作为要澄清的内容，呼应开头的 내 말은。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话、意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"说话者表达的内容；本句是在澄清自己的意思。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"0ce6c4ebbc3bfd23","term":"맡다","zh":"负责","audio":"/audio/0ce6c4ebbc3bfd2367dc.mp3","entryId":"62827","definition":"承担责任做某件事。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"934c2296a0e27580","term":"똑바로","zh":"认真、好好地","audio":"/audio/934c2296a0e275800788.mp3","entryId":"70810","definition":"按要求正确地做事；本句指把负责的工作做好。","pronunciation":["똑빠로"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做好、去做","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行所负责的工作；与 똑바로 连用表示认真做好。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"这件事、这个意思","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"指前面“把分内工作做好”的要求。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee256cba067a3d8ffd11.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60341-1-4-2","ko":"네 말이 그런 뜻이었어? 알겠어.","zh":"你是这个意思啊？我明白了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你的","explanation":"네 是 너의 的缩略形式，修饰后面的 말。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"말이","meaning":"你的话","explanation":"네 말 指你说的话；下文确认其真实含义。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이","audio":"/audio/250054307dc16bb3bc3e.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样。","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"뜻이었어?","meaning":"意，意思","explanation":"뜻：意，意思；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뜻","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43785","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜻","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜻이었어","audio":"/audio/19894b4bd9753e8db3c0.mp3"}},{"text":"알겠어.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알겠어","audio":"/audio/e504586307626e92078c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话、意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"说话者表达的内容；本句是在确认对方的意思。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"883d841ce6a33cf7","term":"뜻","zh":"意，意思","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3","entryId":"43785","definition":"语言、文字或行为所表达的内容。","pronunciation":["뜯"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c946a9bcc017f08e5aa0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.528,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60341","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.582,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你是这个意思啊？我明白了。","这里没有人行横道，要往哪儿过马路呢？","我的意思是，让你把分内的事好好做好。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你是这个意思啊？我明白了。","我的意思是，让你把分内的事好好做好。","这里没有人行横道，要往哪儿过马路呢？"],"answer":0}]}
